cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use, fork, or reference this software or its curated linguistic and geological datasets, please cite the original creator and collaborators as below. Dedicated to Father U Moe Kyaw Thu (ဦးမိုးကျော်သူ), who originally inspired the idea for this project."
type: software
title: "Myanmar Official Spell, Grammar, Contextual Meaning & Dictionary Suite for Microsoft Word and Microsoft Excel"
abstract: "100% Offline, air-gapped Microsoft Word and Microsoft Excel COM Add-in Suite (.NET Framework 4.8) featuring Viterbi word-lattice Burmese orthography proofing, contextual homophone disambiguation, official style rewriting, formula-safe spreadsheet proofing, and a 118,600+ entry Myanmar-to-Myanmar dictionary & encyclopedia including specialized Geology & Earth Sciences terminology. Original idea inspired by Father U Moe Kyaw Thu (ဦးမိုးကျော်သူ)."
authors:
  - name: "Htet Yar Zar (ထက်ရာဇာ)"
